              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kor 1:6-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moyo wangu ulisinizye cintu comwe, cakuti oyo iwakamusaangunina mulimo mubotu unooya buulondola mane kusikila kubuzuba bwa-Jesu Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuleelede kuti miyeeyo yanu njinjeeya ndinywe nyoonse ibe mbubonya obo, nkaambo mumoyo wangu nsikonzyi kuluba kuti, nimuba mubwaange bwangu nimuba mumilimo yakulungulula akusimpikizya Makani Mabotu, nyoonse muli basiluswaananoma kuluzyalo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
