          "text": "Ani nkutinzi? Nkukwaamba buyo kuti muziyanza zyoonse, nikuba kukuupaupa ameso nikuba kulusinizyo, Kristo ulakambaukwa, Lino nciceeci ncenkondelwa, nkabela noozooya bucikondelwa. ",
